CAWG Test Suite (cawg-test-suite)

Test assets under fixtures/assets/ and tools/crjson-gen/cawg_test_settings.toml
are copied from the c2pa-rs project (https://github.com/contentauth/c2pa-rs),
commit ddf97429, and are used under its MIT / Apache-2.0 dual license:

  fixtures/assets/C_with_CAWG_data.jpg          <- sdk/tests/fixtures/
  fixtures/assets/validation_method/*.jpg       <- sdk/src/identity/tests/fixtures/validation_method/
  fixtures/assets/claim_aggregation/**/*.jpg    <- sdk/src/identity/tests/fixtures/claim_aggregation/
  tools/crjson-gen/cawg_test_settings.toml      <- c2pa_c_ffi/tests/fixtures/trust/
  tools/crjson-gen/source/no_manifest.jpg       <- sdk/tests/fixtures/ (commit 58b9a09)
  tools/crjson-gen/signing_settings.toml        <- sdk/tests/fixtures/test_settings_with_cawg_signing.toml
                                                   (commit 58b9a09; TSA disabled)

fixtures/assets/metadata/*.jpg and fixtures/assets/training-mining/*.jpg are
generated by tools/crjson-gen (make-assets)
from no_manifest.jpg, signed with the c2pa-rs test certificates in
signing_settings.toml.

